{"stage": "preparation", "event": "note", "category": "nfr-waiver", "message": "NFR-1 (<150ms glass-to-glass) will NOT be met by v1. Accepted at the clarify gate: v1 ships screenshot polling behind a MirrorTransport interface, with scrcpy-server + in-JVM H.264 decode as an explicit v1.1+ follow-up. Grounds: no H.264 decoder exists anywhere on the classpath (verified against gradle/libs.versions.toml), building one is disproportionate to this deliverable, and the staged interface makes the real transport a drop-in replacement. Deliberate, not an oversight. MUST appear in the final chain report to the operator.", "at": "2026-10-14T23:20:08Z", "spec": "android-device-discovery-mirroring"}
