{"stage": "preparation", "event": "note", "category": "pre-existing-gap", "message": "Brainstorm surfaced a pre-existing repo gap it correctly did NOT silently patch: domain-usecase-impl resultLauncher catches Throwable, which includes CancellationException, so any coroutine timeout inside a use case must use withTimeoutOrNull rather than withTimeout or real cancellation gets swallowed and mapped to a Failure. Affects every existing use case, not just this spec. Carried as a follow-up for the batched retrospective.", "at": "2026-10-14T23:31:21Z", "spec": "android-device-discovery-mirroring"}
